<title>DUBAI: Italian minister signs investment deal in Saudi.</title>
<headline>Italian minister signs investment deal in Saudi.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian Foreign Minister Lamberto Dini on Tuesday met senior Saudi officials and signed a deal to encourage investment, the official Saudi Press Agency reported.</p>
<p>It said Saudi Arabia and Italy signed the agreement to encourage investment and trade during a meeting between Dini and Saudi Arabian Finance Minister Ibrahim Abdel Aziz al-Assaf.</p>
</text>
